id: nested-add
title: Nested add
order: 30
description: Trace nested calls to a function whose name does not match what it does.

[random]
xv = 2..5
yv = 1..4
fn ~ add sum combine mix
px, py, vx, vy, vz ~ x y z a b m n p q r

[code]
def $fn($px, $py):
    $px = $px - $py
    return $px

def main():
    $vx = $xv
    $vy = $yv
    $vz = $fn($vy, $fn($vy, $vx))
    print($vz, $vx, $vy)

if __name__ == "__main__":
    main()
